      "Formulated with filler and rubberized polymer for a tougher film",
      "Water-based with straightforward cleanup",
      "Strong availability at home centers in most regions"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Priced at the top of the retail range",
      "The long warranty-style label is about product tier, not a literal service life"
    ],
